    "title": "Coshocton BPW members to compete in Columbus - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago Business and Professional Women Region 3 held its meeting on Zoom Feb. 28. Members represented were from Coshocton, Guernsey and Noble counties and Zanesville. BPW Region 3 will send two members who will compete at the State Individual Development and Young Careerist competitions Saturday, April 11 in Columbus at the Northwest Library. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
